Hi Noam,
I would be willing to take 15 minutes to discuss how to customize your R startup and use Notepad++ or RStudio.  More specifically, I can discuss how to load sets of functions you may need frequently so they are available, as well as modifying several other options in your "Rprofile.site" file.

I think it can also be helpful to discuss how to include a few lines of code in the top of your script to determine what computer you are working on (work, home, laptop, etc) which then sets a root file path, and then makes it easy to load file paths that may be slightly different across computers (I can also mention choose.file()/file.choose() in case folks aren't aware of it's use).

I'm out of town the next 2 Fridays, but could be available Nov. 2, or Nov. 9th.

And again, thanks for organizing and moderating.

Adios,
Ryan Peek

